<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of JDN Realty Corp with outperform rating, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 to 24 in New York Stock Exchange midday trade.</p>
